<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar o/n average rate falls to 5.80 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar o/n average rate falls to 5.80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 5.80 percent on Thursday from 7.27 percent on Wednesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said three banks traded in five reported transactions worth 11.3 million dinars ($15.9 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
